 "notes": [
  "Kit batch 2005+ (lane kit-batch-2005-20261121), hand-authored from the archived 2025-06-16 crops. Group 0: panel 4 (Veemkade N, 26.2 m, main) plus the small coplanar-ish panels east of it, from w04-16: 22 transom-window axes over 45 m, four brick storeys over a two-storey stone colonnade with glazed shops and a glazed mezzanine, the DETROIT entrance recess at the east end of panel 4.",
  "Group 1: panel 3 surface 78 (W, 12.8 m, 21.5 m) from w02-286: the six-storey north wing, four axes over three tall podium windows. Group 2: panel 6 (W, 30.8 m, 8 m podium) and surface 4 from w02-286: the stone colonnade with the car-park entrance. Groups 3-5: panel 111 (S tower, 18.4 m, 33 m), the tower shoulders (79 surfaces 158/122, panels 10, 139) and the podium surface 86 from w03-196: eight axes on storeys 2-5, four centred axes on storeys 6-9, the glazed stair slot over the entrance. Group 6: the plain brick podium ends (panels 7, 68, 55 W, panel 100 S).",
  "Group 7: the upper setbacks over the W podium (panels 43 tower W face, 19, 44, 22, 92, 8 mid wing, 153 and 46 upper wing) from w02-286, on the tower's storey lines (alignWith 3), 10 axes on panel 153. The Purperhoedenveem (E) side, the N setback (panel 75) and the courtyard have no straight crop and take otherWalls window-grid in the house brick."
 ],
